		<news>
[B]Update - v6.7.82 - August 13th, 2026 [/B]
--[Change] Reorganized My TV Shows and My Movies to put lists under providers names. Ex: My TV Shows > Trakt > Progress Episodes
--[Change] Added support for Scrob. (https://github.com/ellite/scrob)
--[Change] Added support for Floppy. (https://github.com/dannyvfilms/Floppy)
--[Change] Changed labels throughout providers to be consistent.
--[Change] Added support for dropped to all calendar lists.
--[Change] Added support for 3 digit episode numbers from manthock.
--[Change] Management Tools Sections and Managers in context menu updated to add all available options for each provider.
--[Change] Fixed pagination showing Next Page (None) in some instances.
--[Change] Support for lists add from more providers.
--[Change] Changes made to avoid double scrobbles.
--[Change] Fixed My TV Shows and My Movies being incorrectly gated.
--[Fix] Added pagination for user lists.
--[Change] Made all force sync show progress dialogs.
--[Fix] Change made for database on android 14 devices.
--[Change] Change made to allow for sorting networks by popularity.
--[Change] Change to playlist creation to avoid duplicate episodes.
--[Change] MdbList Calendar added.
--[Fix] Changes made for providers to clear cache on full history sync to avoid stale progress indicators.
--[Change] Moved custom trakt provider behind developer options.
--[Fix] Added pagination to MDBList History.
--[Fix] Added progress for sync when changing watch indicators.
--[Change] Made change so that tv and movie lists only showed up if those types of items are present in scrob user lists.
--[Fix] Fix for resume on trakt resetting banner to 0.
--[Fix] Fix to send separate stop event on Floppy to remove now playing banner.
--[Fix] Runtime duration for mdblist fixed.
--[Fix] Fix for hiding collection items from trakt.
--[Change] Change made for Trakt scrobble on pause.
--[Fix] Made changes to the way counts are done when using Simkl
--[Change] Menus changed to group lists from services together. 
--[Change] Added more mdblist lists for tv and movies like watched.
--[Fix] Removed timestamp from Simkl scrobble. Now uses server time.
--[Fix] Made sure scrobble fails no longer show when scrobble notifications are disabled.
--[Fix] Change for settings reads for apple devices to fix long delays.
		</news>
